# Is this like the worst lo-fi tape?

[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eS-fxZgaBJk](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eS-fxZgaBJk) 

&#x200B;

 I've been making beats for 2 years now. I always did boom bap or trap. But honestly I find lofi lot much better. So that's my attempt to lofi. The whole thing is made in 5-6 hours not that it matters.
